{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":16,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["夏甲和以實瑪利"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亞伯蘭的妻子撒萊不給他生兒女。撒萊有一個使女，名叫夏甲，是埃及人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["撒萊對亞伯蘭說：「耶和華使我不能生育。求你和我的使女同房，或者我可以因她得孩子",{"noteId":7},"。」亞伯蘭聽從了撒萊的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["於是亞伯蘭的妻子撒萊將使女埃及人夏甲給了丈夫為妾；那時亞伯蘭在迦南已經住了十年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["亞伯蘭與夏甲同房，夏甲就懷了孕；她見自己有孕，就小看她的主母。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["撒萊對亞伯蘭說：「我因你受屈。我將我的使女放在你懷中，她見自己有了孕，就小看我。願耶和華在你我中間判斷。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["亞伯蘭對撒萊說：「使女在你手下，你可以隨意待她。」撒萊苦待她，她就從撒萊面前逃走了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["耶和華的使者在曠野書珥路上的水泉旁遇見她，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["對她說：「撒萊的使女夏甲，你從哪裏來？要往哪裏去？」夏甲說：「我從我的主母撒萊面前逃出來。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["耶和華的使者對她說：「你回到你主母那裏，服在她手下」；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又說：「我必使你的後裔極其繁多，甚至不可勝數」；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["並說：「你如今懷孕要生一個兒子，可以給他起名叫以實瑪利",{"noteId":8},"，因為耶和華聽見了你的苦情。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他為人必像野驢。他的手要攻打人，人的手也要攻打他；他必住在眾弟兄的東邊。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["夏甲就稱那對她說話的耶和華為「看顧人的上帝」。因而說：「在這裏我也看見那看顧我的嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所以這井名叫庇耳‧拉海‧萊。這井正在加低斯和巴列中間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["後來夏甲給亞伯蘭生了一個兒子；亞伯蘭給他起名叫以實瑪利。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["夏甲給亞伯蘭生以實瑪利的時候，亞伯蘭年八十六歲。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"得孩子：原文是被建立","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":2}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"就是上帝聽見的意思","reference":{"chapter":16,"verse":11}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/16.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/17.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/15.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}